WEBVTT

00:27:55.786 --> 00:28:01.820
because the values and aspirations
were preached in such an aspirational way?

00:28:01.844 --> 00:28:03.601
Or do you have a different analysis

00:28:03.625 --> 00:28:06.296
of where it started to unfold?

00:28:08.124 --> 00:28:09.308
DF: I definitely think

00:28:09.332 --> 00:28:14.297
that that is the source
of a lot of the disappointment.

00:28:14.321 --> 00:28:19.603
That what was presented
as what the organization stood for,

00:28:19.627 --> 00:28:24.068
as more and more commercial
pressure mounted,

00:28:24.092 --> 00:28:26.148
you know, being public
and things like that,

00:28:26.172 --> 00:28:28.486
some of those things were harder to live.

00:28:28.510 --> 00:28:31.221
I don't think there's
necessarily a one to one.